    {
      "title": "用 AI 把重复工作压到最低",
      "author": "lzwmt",
      "digest": "用本地安全模块重做一版更接近 API 排版观感的公众号文章样例。",
      "content": "<section style=\"background: #fffdf9; border: 1px solid #f0dfd1; border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px 24px; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(181, 111, 68, 0.08); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.35; color: #7c2d12; margin: 8px 0 20px;\">用 AI 把重复工作压到最低</h1><p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9a7b67; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 18px;; margin-right: 12px;\">作者：lzwmt</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9a7b67; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 18px;\">摘要：用本地安全模块重做一版更接近 API 排版观感的公众号文章样例。</p><div class=\"verdict\" style=\"margin: 16px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #fdf1e6; border: 1px solid #f0dfd1; border-left: 5px solid #9a3412; color: #7c2d12; font-weight: 600;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">结论：AI 最值得接手的，不是最终拍板，而是那些重复、机械、低判断密度的中间处理环节。</p>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">很多人第一次用 AI，会本能地想：能不能让它多干一点。</p>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">但真正拉开效率差距的，不是“多做”，而是“少重复”。</p>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-tone=\"info\" style=\"margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; color: #6f4e37; background: #fff4eb; border-left: 4px solid #d97758;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">把 AI 当成高速度中间处理器，而不是一步到位答案机，通常更稳，也更省时间。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #9a3412; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7c6ae;\">什么叫低价值重复</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">低价值重复，通常有三个共同点：</p>\n<div class=\"cards\" style=\"margin: 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">步骤重复</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">每次流程都差不多，只是内容换了一批。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">判断稀薄</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">花时间，但不太消耗真正的判断力。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">必须完成</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">不做不行，做完却没有明显成就感。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">比如：整理日报、转换格式、补说明文案、写测试样例、查配置路径。</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #9a3412; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7c6ae;\">AI 最适合接手哪一段</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">最适合交给 AI 的，通常不是最后拍板，而是中间那段机械处理。</p>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">你仍然保留判断权，但把搬运、归纳、润色、格式化、归类交出去。</p>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-tone=\"success\" style=\"margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; color: #6f4e37; background: #eefbf3; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">人做判断，AI 做整理，这是大多数知识工作里最容易稳定复用的组合。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #9a3412; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7c6ae;\">一个简单工作流</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">如果把日常工作拆开，通常可以分成三层：</p>\n<div class=\"steps\" style=\"margin: 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n  <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffcf8;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">第一层：原始输入</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">想法、草稿、链接、会议记录、聊天摘录。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffcf8;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">第二层：中间处理</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">归纳、改写、转结构、补格式、压缩冗余。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"step\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffcf8;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">第三层：最终输出</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">文章、报告、脚本、可直接发布的内容。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">AI 最擅长的，往往是第二层。</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #9a3412; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7c6ae;\">为什么很多人越用越累</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">因为他们让 AI 一开始就承担“最终答案”的角色。</p>\n<p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0;\">一旦预期变成一步到位，后面就很容易陷入反复修、反复换 prompt、反复推倒重来。</p>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-tone=\"warn\" style=\"margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; color: #6f4e37; background: #fff3e8; border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">如果你的目标是直接拿到终稿，AI 的不稳定会被无限放大；如果你的目标是先拿到高质量毛坯，体验会好很多。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #9a3412; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7c6ae;\">适合先交给 AI 的任务</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\" style=\"margin: 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">信息整理</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">把零散笔记整理成结构化提纲。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">语言改写</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">把技术描述变成更顺的对外表达。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">格式转换</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">把文档、表格、Markdown、脚本输出互相转换。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ead3c2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fffaf5; box-shadow: none;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b45309; margin: 22px 0 10px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">样例生成</h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">快速补测试数据、说明文案、演示内容。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #9a3412; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7c6ae;\">最后一句</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\" style=\"margin: 16px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #fdf1e6; border: 1px solid #f0dfd1; border-left: 5px solid #9a3412; color: #7c2d12; font-weight: 600;\">\n  <p style=\"color: #4a413d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 16px 0; margin: 0;\">别先问 AI 能不能替你完成全部工作，先问这件事里哪一段最重复、最机械、最不值得你亲自做。</p>\n</div></section>",
      "thumb_media_id": "hhSZwwwIqs3SvJXN9JDYu8TX1f6uj_HIxUFy4FFoG_u73bj6pDLADAzg95sQH-6T",
